      "questionId": "qe-c01-0051",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-03090-s002",
      "sentenceText": "When you’re devoted to making a difference in the world, your life certainly has a point.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d9b20c2a5c1d7461dd27b3a34c06ed784142a16cc7105f91c783043822aa840c",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-03090-r002-005",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-067",
      "parentFingerprint": "024b6e6c71f6419092541b23295d757437f7d7be66c49b366505a380290b66db",
      "passageSha256": "cdf6ccade6371952930c646b28c174d1950cd01af15fa2b10d8642be18754dd6",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0052",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-03090-s003",
      "sentenceText": "You see the fruits of your labor, your legacy.",
      "sentenceSha256": "38b98acef65512a159213f79698650ee70a7c326a937ae5091e8d80c8b2aff95",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-03090-r002-005",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-067",
      "parentFingerprint": "024b6e6c71f6419092541b23295d757437f7d7be66c49b366505a380290b66db",
      "passageSha256": "cdf6ccade6371952930c646b28c174d1950cd01af15fa2b10d8642be18754dd6",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0053",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-03090-s004",
      "sentenceText": "There is a reason for your existence.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4aaebb0fed2e6f8f3949b8c390d107081d1de72594c78555b4f8444fc5845423",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-03090-r002-005",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-067",
      "parentFingerprint": "024b6e6c71f6419092541b23295d757437f7d7be66c49b366505a380290b66db",
      "passageSha256": "cdf6ccade6371952930c646b28c174d1950cd01af15fa2b10d8642be18754dd6",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0054",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-03090-s006",
      "sentenceText": "The Scottish singer-songwriter Lewis Capaldi sang in the song “Pointless”: “Of all the dreams I’m chasing…Everything is pointless without you.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "3e985f5690119a091883e063bc56a724d6f122dd22a659638494a933bf17178b",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-03090-r006-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-068",
      "parentFingerprint": "46461779fff0153dec6d194b6dc312da043092b92b4df200107faae1d0e7de63",
      "passageSha256": "dc79db4418bfb5f164902301b9d642a9293470250eaa1a5d80dc8c81e78c44b1",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0055",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-04650-s003",
      "sentenceText": "I was more respected by my kinsfolk and acquaintance than I had ever been; I was loaded with praise by strangers; and without exaggeration I could believe my name already famous….",
      "sentenceSha256": "38d6ac5adbf66fde7c8f4587ea9a272b85fda6bd0448324380a6983e5315ac7c",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-04650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "4462efacbca8ac5136e2f46022cf542dc6c5cf315b68118a1dcfcf460b2c8aae",
      "passageSha256": "cf8bb2eb9f5b136110536b699c42157fb684c29eea4fbe5d6c15664ce46031b6",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0056",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s05-p015-01260-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In the same way that material richness can be quantified by money—the more money you have, the richer you are materially—psychological richness can be quantified by experiences.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7b2209596b2b2f51d2314a12a3c06ee6f87512cfe88fe069023d3560815d7c6f",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s05-p015-01260-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-070",
      "parentFingerprint": "549f4c7dd08440568f7016397799e4b121b207349639628527d9e04db33d957f",
      "passageSha256": "a220d3be4c034e05f969d5ca1e2794ba52ebba3408518ccebc48f38402faaefd",
      "pdfPages": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0057",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s05-p015-04972-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Therefore, anyone can benefit from the lessons of psychological richness research.",
      "sentenceSha256": "dd6d002d9fd18b5a0a24e03f0702e0d0638855d1039a9d4def7e42cb3647dfe1",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s05-p015-04972-r006-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-074",
      "parentFingerprint": "7c99e12ec3489b64f2e4415e84da2e0b683bd8c1d0bc5376b2cc86c4113632e1",
      "passageSha256": "5e55a52207a8f8a524fcccd78fd275658d3c63b191bff2f8dfb89fc0488fab6a",
      "pdfPages": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0058",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s05-p016-01725-s005",
      "sentenceText": "What are the benefits of a psychologically rich life?",
      "sentenceSha256": "31b6d439b00bc658f929e9510830fc21eb6a119f04cbca1a4558f03b6e04ac1d",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s05-p016-01725-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "3a971a5a5d430c0758c86b716869aac71523578519c911e2b7b4fc3798beaeab",
      "passageSha256": "c767ba280902ed2b1ad8632f04cb8da4a3d3a2071228a2bca54829cc7374b6a5",
      "pdfPages": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0059",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s05-p016-01725-s006",
      "sentenceText": "How can we enrich our lives psychologically?",
      "sentenceSha256": "7ef16af5b9a317979fc9a0575a168c52196fc3df31461c59f11983d93cb26552",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s05-p016-01725-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "3a971a5a5d430c0758c86b716869aac71523578519c911e2b7b4fc3798beaeab",
      "passageSha256": "c767ba280902ed2b1ad8632f04cb8da4a3d3a2071228a2bca54829cc7374b6a5",
      "pdfPages": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0001",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p017-03608-s006",
      "sentenceText": "It is a worthy goal, as research shows that happy people are healthier and more prosocial.",
      "sentenceSha256": "df45feb1fdc18c2d9118e3dac7846f2d49a2967b7f3d0795b7d95211a8fb2904",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p017-03608-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-029",
      "parentFingerprint": "64c5dc6bf67aace040be43335261294049989a74c95d16bb6eb8857a8ed7691b",
      "passageSha256": "9f969ca8a395c0ca5d016dbc131dc53f2817b8a7666effa848f1072cfd905ade",
      "pdfPages": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0002",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p017-03608-s007",
      "sentenceText": "They’re also better workers, and they live longer than unhappy people.",
      "sentenceSha256": "42859995cee296c20e3a2b8d165dfbec283c1222bd3bc98638c69884a0efc47b",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p017-03608-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-029",
      "parentFingerprint": "64c5dc6bf67aace040be43335261294049989a74c95d16bb6eb8857a8ed7691b",
      "passageSha256": "9f969ca8a395c0ca5d016dbc131dc53f2817b8a7666effa848f1072cfd905ade",
      "pdfPages": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0003",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p017-05558-s002",
      "sentenceText": "We put undue pressure and stress on ourselves to always be happy, preventing ourselves from reaping the benefits.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e7eb3494cf107059320095f356f19c9777319d733d67e70ffd285cc01f0d33c2",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p017-05558-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-002",
      "parentFingerprint": "7f3daf19df606271c52e5729c43c3c20e582bf41670d38d7bed19ecc57134c89",
      "passageSha256": "2db1c55463e46a67407fbb9879287e8dfbb858d1d54a9bebbe4faf4f698c3b2e",
      "pdfPages": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0004",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p017-05558-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Take Madison Holleran, a “popular, attractive, and talented” first-year student at the University of Pennsylvania.",
      "sentenceSha256": "96eff087b9773d05a45bba9c1054ed857264cc7f80bec1d9ae98515c21ac7ef1",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p017-05558-r003-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "d532c9d28f830aa7b635a04d2ce10291751432774bc7d158eb923298dc6289e6",
      "passageSha256": "9200999175ffb75c3627daa561308add7cf7050ab85e2d1b835b204bb146a384",
      "pdfPages": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0005",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p017-05558-s008",
      "sentenceText": "On January 17, 2014, Madison jumped off the top of a parking garage and took her own life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "887cf79c7b140e3a1ecd5a20170ef3638d250b386e9d5d34ab932b88c7d3a955",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p017-05558-r007-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-031",
      "parentFingerprint": "8ac19308f01748739fba08bffeebcf578b54a06dbc560f942913153c6d593bcb",
      "passageSha256": "16184b6d133d51db5ce14b24bba35f22c10f264240e367b277f9686e84272674",
      "pdfPages": [
        17,
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0006",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-01140-s003",
      "sentenceText": "What is shocking is how good she was at pretending to be happy in public, and that a person who appeared so well adjusted and happy also had profound inner struggles leading to a tragic fate.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7c7a6afa5fad0b756625505f15e978d61d117f3f5ae7b082615d4e7752521108",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-01140-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-032",
      "parentFingerprint": "97e219e9ae3c640b445a890cac15b0c7b2b8d0a0a5584b7c7837006703b982ab",
      "passageSha256": "a1a3507b75c890f770af811a5bec5b61a7ac72d37919da0af4faf37776f11b92",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0007",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-01140-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Was she an exception or a rule?",
      "sentenceSha256": "0fda22650e4541f1e781760f749f34e6b6de3c197ea7d434ca450bf6ca456cd5",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-01140-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-032",
      "parentFingerprint": "97e219e9ae3c640b445a890cac15b0c7b2b8d0a0a5584b7c7837006703b982ab",
      "passageSha256": "a1a3507b75c890f770af811a5bec5b61a7ac72d37919da0af4faf37776f11b92",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0008",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-s001",
      "sentenceText": "According to vital statistics from the Centers for Disease Control (CDC), suicide among Americans increased 38 percent between 2000 to 2018.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5666a9d47861e5caf9f6aa31ca239703562980ef7920505dfa41b98d973f7702",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "b1614bb5382deabebba6fbeb201070a135004f23418aa806b95f37a296b3abf7",
      "passageSha256": "a0ab6a2e7ecb079645a15f50fe243b5e3ffc10eda5c1c1202bab74e96fd130b5",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0009",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Suicide is still somewhat rare.",
      "sentenceSha256": "45c93924a9194a48558a55636c382d17711d1cd4702f17a6dc226c7813ea64de",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "b1614bb5382deabebba6fbeb201070a135004f23418aa806b95f37a296b3abf7",
      "passageSha256": "a0ab6a2e7ecb079645a15f50fe243b5e3ffc10eda5c1c1202bab74e96fd130b5",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0010",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-s004",
      "sentenceText": "However, suicidal ideation is not.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a2962e148e1951a92a13bebf60d105bfe682b7c8ecb61772ba71ab10575e58f4",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "b1614bb5382deabebba6fbeb201070a135004f23418aa806b95f37a296b3abf7",
      "passageSha256": "a0ab6a2e7ecb079645a15f50fe243b5e3ffc10eda5c1c1202bab74e96fd130b5",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0011",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-s006",
      "sentenceText": "That means roughly 1 in 20 American adults seriously thought about dying by suicide that year.",
      "sentenceSha256": "227242be6e77bbc0f0f5ef9281bc52202665e1e4b3b5f109354a483c6aecc20e",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "08d29ca23853d3d5ea1bc96d804e299d1d85424a9a89e53ef41f535ae64ccf9e",
      "passageSha256": "348f1e14396911bbdbd74918002c95a5f706594bf1a3486156f67936eaa41537",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0012",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-s007",
      "sentenceText": "That is a lot.",
      "sentenceSha256": "72b9262f3d9d234d1aea2feb4fe04f6a0790b0fb23bed5acb13618b4fa1fa3e8",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "08d29ca23853d3d5ea1bc96d804e299d1d85424a9a89e53ef41f535ae64ccf9e",
      "passageSha256": "348f1e14396911bbdbd74918002c95a5f706594bf1a3486156f67936eaa41537",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0013",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-s008",
      "sentenceText": "If you look at the frequency of suicidal thoughts, then, Madison’s case doesn’t seem so rare.",
      "sentenceSha256": "08209ed57ffb2359d90a54ea6777dcd4a5e2255d0bc6487f49b03f2eecba617c",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-02310-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "08d29ca23853d3d5ea1bc96d804e299d1d85424a9a89e53ef41f535ae64ccf9e",
      "passageSha256": "348f1e14396911bbdbd74918002c95a5f706594bf1a3486156f67936eaa41537",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0014",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-04650-s001",
      "sentenceText": "At the core of the pressure to be happy is the American cultural construction of happiness as something achievable.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6fb598911210536adf7bc2312cda88656abdfd16f5a8ac2337c0701af51a2c1b",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-04650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-036",
      "parentFingerprint": "5337d70873d178f3548eee7f761418789d6b6b9456e0828d8534ab7509251621",
      "passageSha256": "09d06f02707d625a51799e507e84eda891c53d2d415532320ed7bcaba43d9886",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0015",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-04650-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In one study, American college students were asked to write about anything that came to mind when they thought about “happiness.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "b4d5c602ec51fe5796c889311a3f2a36ac45ff38fa30bb3e4555e2b24c72b501",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-04650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-036",
      "parentFingerprint": "5337d70873d178f3548eee7f761418789d6b6b9456e0828d8534ab7509251621",
      "passageSha256": "09d06f02707d625a51799e507e84eda891c53d2d415532320ed7bcaba43d9886",
      "pdfPages": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0016",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s01-p018-04650-s005",
      "sentenceText": "That is, there is a strong association between happiness and success.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3e39ad745410dbd65441ee55e544b9d0f8487867031fcf2e271e1b0d99c85baf",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s01-p018-04650-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "c74dd3c9170f1379e4110fe46ffa8c606a4d4ba33f63a8cdd89689a09a5e4ae1",
      "passageSha256": "7f6ed2173e741ac760b24349fc4c6d57c0a978c1b1df0efac0cdfd1a804d2bee",
